47. In the result, we pass the following order:
i. The Writ Petition is partly allowed;
ii. The notification dated 29th January, 2025 excluding

 Note 1 to Entry 8(a) is upheld;
iii. Note 1 to Entry 8(a) of the notification dated 29 th

 January, 2025 is quashed and set aside;
iv. The O.M. dated 30th January, 2025 issued by the

 MoEF&CC is also upheld; and

 v. In the facts and circumstances, no orders as to costs.

